actually can aid in the remineralization of demineralized tooth surfaces. See specific risk factors in Box 19-4 . Oral and Pharyngeal Cancer Oral and pharyngeal cancers occur in the oral cavity, lips,"}], "allowed_evidence_ids": ["I1", "I2", "I3"]}
