{"question": "Theo lời cô McKinney, những kỹ năng nào là thiết yếu khi làm việc trong y tế công cộng?", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "title": "Chapter 19: Current Oral Epidemiological Findings", "content": "dental ­sealants create a barrier to protect fissures and pits from demineralization."}, {"evidence_id": "I2", "title": "Chapter 3: Dental Care Delivery in the United States", "content": "Ms. McKinney previously worked as a patient care coordinator with the National Institutes of Health in Bethesda, Maryland. She treated medically compromised and acutely ill patients and provided oral health education for health care providers."}], "allowed_evidence_ids": ["I1", "I2"]}
